# LeakSanitizer suppressions for kajo-comp test runs (spec §7.3.2).
# Only third-party driver internals belong here; never suppress our own code.
#
# Mesa's EGL driver keeps per-display allocations that it does not free at
# eglTerminate (seen with the GLES2 renderer on Intel Lunar Lake, Mesa 26.2.6,
# 2026-11-10). The pixman and Vulkan renderers do not trigger this.
leak:libEGL_mesa.so
